# Creative Intelligence PoC — environment configuration
# The app runs fully on fixture data with NO keys set.
# Real providers activate automatically when their keys are present (later iterations).

# SQLite database file (default: ./var/poc.db)
# CI_DB_PATH=./var/poc.db

# --- Deep AI Analysis ---
# With a key set, the Claude engine (claude-opus-4-8) generates real analyses;
# without one, a clearly-labeled heuristic fixture engine serves demo output.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# CI_ANALYSIS_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# --- Later iterations (real discovery providers) ---
# SCRAPECREATORS_API_KEY=
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
